-- נספח א'6 — טבלת המרה לשכר מורים קיימים בדרגת 'מוסמך' (קוד דירוג 105), מעודכנת החל מיום 1.9.2022: the conversion
-- table of an existing teacher of the certified rank (מוסמך) (rating code 105) from 1.9.2022, as the
-- conditions-of-service portal publishes it — a page of the wage
-- agreement of 19.10.2022 as signed, with its hand-written page number and
-- the parties' note that the annexes are agreed. It is annex א6 of that
-- agreement, which §4.1 makes the table from 1.9.2022 and which the
-- agreement's signed copy prints after its signatures (encoded, imported).
-- A conversion table is the salary table with the intermediate grades,
-- "for the conversion only" (the base agreement's §46(א)).
--
-- Checked here over every cell: the table is the signed copy's annex א6
-- cell for cell, and prints the day §4.1 applies it from. The decision of 14.1.2025 leaves
-- it standing (its §3 replaces only the BA and MA tables and their
-- supplements).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספח א'6 — טבלת המרה לשכר מורים קיימים בדרגת 'מוסמך' (קוד דירוג 105), 1.9.2022`

