#ASSERT `the published table pay on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) `annex א'6 of 1.9.2022` 3 1.5 EQUALS `the table salary under §4 on` 6 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1 3 1.5
